(7700710, 1263758, 38162, '<td valign="top">US faux prude culture will score this low but natural and relaxed women win me over. GL. 9.</td>', 'US faux prude culture will score this low but natural and relaxed women win me over. GL. 9.', '2021-09-08 12:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
