(7700773, 1264093, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. as in WOW for everything .. the drama .. the colours .. the impact .. the perfect composition .. the scene .. and what i really love is the craggy black lines in the road .. maybe from tar or something .. but to me that boosts this shot from pretty damn cool ... to AWESOME .. <br/>seeing ribbon .. altho i havent seen all your competition yet .. ;)</td>', 'WOW .. as in WOW for everything .. the drama .. the colours .. the impact .. the perfect composition .. the scene .. and what i really love is the craggy black lines in the road .. maybe from tar or something .. but to me that boosts this shot from pretty damn cool ... to AWESOME .. seeing ribbon .. altho i havent seen all your competition yet .. ;)', '2021-09-08 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
