(7701283, 1264032, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>My eye follows the rolling road as it weaves through the hills. The green countryside promises one a scenic and pastoral drive. Nice capture!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment: My eye follows the rolling road as it weaves through the hills. The green countryside promises one a scenic and pastoral drive. Nice capture!', '2021-09-14 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701285, 1263998, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>At first glance this captures the spirit and feel of taking a ''Sunday drive'' to explore scenic highways and byways. I then noticed that there was no driver and this was a clever and creative capture using a toy car and road to capture the mood and feel of a road trip. I wonder if it would have been better to turn the car the other way (traveling away from viewer) so that it would be harder to notice no driver and thus make it easier to maintain the illusion of this being a classic roadster on the seaside highway. Still, I really like the mood and creativeness of this photo and it is among one of my highest votes - can see this in the top 5.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment: At first glance this captures the spirit and feel of taking a ''Sunday drive'' to explore scenic highways and byways. I then noticed that there was no driver and this was a clever and creative capture using a toy car and road to capture the mood and feel of a road trip. I wonder if it would have been better to turn the car the other way (traveling away from viewer) so that it would be harder to notice no driver and thus make it easier to maintain the illusion of this being a classic roadster on the seaside highway. Still, I really like the mood and creativeness of this photo and it is among one of my highest votes - can see this in the top 5.', '2021-09-14 11:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701286, 1264101, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>The rains have stopped and the morning haze &amp; light brushes across the countryside. Road trip! Time to pop in your favorite soundtrack/music, hit play, take the wheel and hit the road with the windows down. Love how inviting this capture is explore what lays ahead! Can see this in the top 5.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment: The rains have stopped and the morning haze & light brushes across the countryside. Road trip! Time to pop in your favorite soundtrack/music, hit play, take the wheel and hit the road with the windows down. Love how inviting this capture is explore what lays ahead! Can see this in the top 5.', '2021-09-14 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7701287, 1264103, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment:<br/> <br/>I can almost breath the clean fresh air while strolling along in this forest path! Love the verdant greens and distinctive trees that line this pathway!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment: I can almost breath the clean fresh air while strolling along in this forest path! Love the verdant greens and distinctive trees that line this pathway!', '2021-09-14 11:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
