(7701423, 1264123, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks familiar. Is this Guanajuato by any chance? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes!!! I''m impressed. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ha! It''s not very common (very rare, in fact) to see cars parked inside a tunnel. Guanajuato was one of those places. What an interesting town! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a marvelous place! I enjoyed it immensely. I loved the underground streets.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Originally posted by vawendy: Originally posted by LevT: Looks familiar. Is this Guanajuato by any chance?   Yes!!! I''m impressed. :)  Ha! It''s not very common (very rare, in fact) to see cars parked inside a tunnel. Guanajuato was one of those places. What an interesting town!   It''s a marvelous place! I enjoyed it immensely. I loved the underground streets.', '2021-09-15 17:10:36.000000', NULL, 0),
